1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,350
Writing, task one. Form number 2. You want to register at the city library. Answer the registration questions. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:15,246
What books or magazines do you like to read?

3
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:30,424
I like reading detective stories and historical novels, sometimes also a cooking magazine.

4
00:00:31,333 --> 00:00:33,626
Why do you want to register at our library?

5
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:48,342
I want to register because books are expensive and I want to read more in Czech.

6
00:00:49,233 --> 00:00:51,033
When do you have time to go to the library?

7
00:01:01,433 --> 00:01:05,540
I can go to the library on Tuesday and Thursday afternoons or on Saturday morning.

8
00:01:06,433 --> 00:01:15,082
Fill in form 2 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
